    "updated_at": "2017-05-30T09:03:38Z",
    "body": "Thanks for starting this discussion! And here I thought Blink was the only engine to ever do \"A\". Note that Blink is expected to change to \"AC\" soon. [1]\r\n\r\nIt would be tempting to just add \"hr { display:flow-root; }\" to the UA stylesheet. As long as HR is painted using borders, we certainly don't want floats to overlap with them, and the \"C\" and \"A\" types just seem bogus to me.\r\n\r\n[1] https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/512824/",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
